Alexandre Belloni wrote:

Hi Alexandre,

> 
> The Microsemi Ocelot SoC has a pretty simple IRQ controller in its ICPU
> block. Add a driver for it.
> 
> Signed-off-by: Alexandre Belloni <alexandre.belloni@bootlin.com>
> ---
